Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,《Apologize》\NOneRepublic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holdin' on your rope\N♪ 我紧握你给的希望之索 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me ten feet off the ground\N♪ 使我如坠深渊双脚悬空 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm hearin' what you say\N♪ 我倾听着你的每句言语 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just can't make a sound, no\N♪ 却只剩无言的沉默 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me that you need me\N♪ 你说你如此需要我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you go and cut me down, but wait\N♪ 转身却将我推落深渊 且慢 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me that you're sorry\N♪ 你轻声道出歉疚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think I'd turn around and say\N♪ 未料我决然转身宣言 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's too late to apologize\N♪ 此刻道歉已为时太晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:01:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize\N♪ 我说过歉意来得太迟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take another chance\N♪ 我愿再赌一次机会 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a fall, take a shot for you\N♪ 为你承受伤害 再尝心碎 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I need you like a heart needs a beat\N♪ 我需要你如心跳般本能 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's nothing new\N♪ 可这早非新鲜事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved you with a fire red\N♪ 曾爱你似烈火炽红 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's turnin' blue and you say\N♪ 而今冷却成冰蓝 你却说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry like the angel\N♪ "抱歉"如天使般圣洁 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven let me think was you, but I'm afraid\N♪ 让我错觉你来自天堂 可我深恐 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to apologize\N♪ 此刻道歉已为时太晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize\N♪ 我说过歉意来得太迟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:02:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-oh, oh\N♪ 喔—— ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to apologize\N♪ 此刻道歉已为时太晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize\N♪ 我说过歉意来得太迟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late\N♪ 为时已晚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize, yeah\N♪ 我说过道歉已迟 是的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize\N♪ 我说过歉意来得太迟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holdin' on your rope\N♪ 我仍紧握那希望之索 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:03:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me ten feet off the ground\N♪ 任我坠向无底深渊 ♪